{
  "_comment": "SMS parsing rules. Every field is a regex (or list tried in order); capture group 1 is the value. Macros: {AMOUNT} any number, {MONEY} number with comma or 2 decimals, {DATE} dd/mm/yy(yy) or '25 ต.ค. 69', {CARD} 4 digits. Sender ids are examples: check the real sender names on your phone and adjust.",
